---
title: "Order lookup"
---
sequenceDiagram
  %% id: web
  participant n1 as Web shop
  %% id: api
  participant n2@{ "type" : "control" } as Order service
  %% id: db
  participant n3@{ "type" : "database" } as Order database
  %% id: m1
  n1->>n2: GET /orders/#123;id#125;
  %% id: n1
  Note over n1,n2: Cache key is the order id plus the tenant prefix
  %% id: m2
  n2->>n3: SELECT order
  %% id: m3
  n3-->>n2: order row
  %% id: n2
  Note over n2,n3: Rows older than two years are read from the archive schema instead of the live one
  %% id: m4
  n2-->>n1: 200 OK (order JSON)
  %% id: n3
  Note over n1,n2: Response is gzip compressed when the client sends Accept-Encoding gzip and the body is larger than 1 KB
